      <h3 id="vsphere-formatting-volumes_persistent-storage-efs" class="group scroll-mt-20">Formatting VMware vSphere volumes<a href="#vsphere-formatting-volumes_persistent-storage-efs" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
